      "body": "Heat 2 in of oil to <span class=\"rc-nw\">340 °F <span class=\"rc-muted\">(171 °C)</span></span>. Fry one cutlet 1 min per side, undisturbed for the first 30 s. Rest on the rack 4 min. Repeat."
